{#- The last section of an inner page (content file 4.5): a section's opening, heading in seven columns
    and the words and two buttons in five, on a lit paper band. A page's closing front matter replaces
    any of the four parts; closing.actions: true sets the four contact actions in the buttons' place
    (Partnerships, content 5.14), under the words in the same five columns, the heading then standing
    level with the words' first line. The notice for individuals follows when the page asks for it.
    The solid button opens the enquiry form where the reader is (enquire.json; the enquire filter):
    solid: { text, enquire: true }, or with what it knows, { text, who | condition | topic } (a test's
    page names its condition, Technology the dossier); one with only an href is a plain link. -#}
{%- from "actions.njk" import actionList with context -%}
{%- set ask = closing or {} -%}
{%- set solid = ask.solid or site.closing.solid -%}
{%- set solidAttrs = ({ who: solid.who, condition: solid.condition, topic: solid.topic } | enquire) if (solid.enquire or solid.who or solid.condition or solid.topic) else ('href="' + solid.href + '"') -%}
{%- set line = ask.line or site.closing.line -%}
<section class="section bg-paper closing" aria-labelledby="closing-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-start">
      <h2 id="closing-h" class="h2 lg:col-span-6">{{ (ask.h2 or site.closing.h2) | unbracket | safe }}</h2>
      <div class="lg:col-span-6">
        <p class="lead">{{ (ask.body or site.closing.body) | unbracket }}</p>
        {%- if ask.actions %}
        {{ actionList("mt-6") }}
        {%- else %}
        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a class="btn btn-solid" {{ solidAttrs | safe }}>{{ solid.text | unbracket }}</a>
          <a class="btn btn-line" href="{{ line.href }}">{{ line.text }}</a>
        </div>
        {%- endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
    {%- if notice %}
    <div class="mt-12">
      {% include "notice.njk" %}
    </div>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</section>
